<title>SWITZERLAND: World outlook good for growth, inflation-Tietmeyer.</title>
<headline>World outlook good for growth, inflation-Tietmeyer.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said the world economic outlook was good in terms of growth and inflation.</p>
<p>&quot;The economic situation worldwide is on a positive way as far as growth and inflation is concerned,&quot; he told reporters after a meeting of G10 central bankers.  </p>
<p>Tietmeyer did not elaborate.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
